      "message": "I don\u0027t think we want this to be a product variable, as it allows any module to reference it. Also, with the way you currently have it set up, if you have a boot config file but not raw boot config arguments, the genrule will be generated without a command at all.\n\nCould we instead keep this variable in `PartitionVarsForSoongMigrationOnlyDoNotUse` and just generate the genrule command with it\u0027s contents hardcoded into it?",
